{
  "_comment": "Remote inputs for Ignition Studio — see apps/ignition-studio/src/remote.rs. `midi` is one controller or a list; every port present connects. A binding is a bare verb (go, look_go, play, stop, blind, highlight, lowlight, page_next, page_prev, release, rate, size, speed, program_time, dimmer) or an object: {fader: n}, {key: {index: n, action: Flash|Toggle|Swap|Kill|Black}}, {master: role}, {solo: role}, {page: n}, {playback_master: Song|Look}, {load: n}, or the verbs grand, tap, half, double, reset_speed, pause, go_back, sound_fade. CC values map 0..127 onto the control's travel; notes are press and release. `feedback` at the top is where OSC feedback goes (/fader/N, /key/N, /page, /master/song, /master/look, /grand); a device with \"feedback\": true is sent its own CCs and notes back.",

